# Optional RPC endpoints for ChainScope scanning.
#
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED. The sweep runs on free public endpoints, which is
# enough for targeted work. An authenticated endpoint only helps when sweeping
# thousands of addresses, where public nodes rate-limit.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in only what you have. `.env` is gitignored - verify
# with `git check-ignore .env` before adding anything real. Never paste a key
# into chat, a commit, or a log.
#
# A 240-address Polygon sweep once reported "no code" for every single target
# because polygon-rpc.com started answering 401 without an API key. If a sweep
# returns 100% unreachable, suspect the endpoint before believing the result.
#
#   ALCHEMY_MAINNET=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<KEY>
#   ALCHEMY_ARBITRUM=https://arb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<KEY>
#   ALCHEMY_POLYGON=https://polygon-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<KEY>
#   ALCHEMY_BASE=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<KEY>
#   ALCHEMY_OPTIMISM=https://opt-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<KEY>
#
# Verified-free fallbacks (no key, no signup):
#   https://ethereum.publicnode.com
#   https://arbitrum-one-rpc.publicnode.com
#   https://polygon-bor-rpc.publicnode.com
#   https://base-rpc.publicnode.com
#   https://optimism-rpc.publicnode.com
#   https://bsc-rpc.publicnode.com
#   https://avalanche-c-chain-rpc.publicnode.com

ALCHEMY_MAINNET=
ALCHEMY_ARBITRUM=
ALCHEMY_POLYGON=
ALCHEMY_BASE=
ALCHEMY_OPTIMISM=
